          "type": "text",
          "text": "Round 1: Chain 7. Working along chain: 2 sc in 2nd ch from hook, sc in next 4 ch, 3 sc in last ch, rotate. Along opposite side: sc in next 4 ch, 2 sc in last ch (16 st)"
        }
